# Environment and secrets
.env
*.pem
*.key

# Build artefacts and binaries: what `go build ./...` drops in the
# working directory, one per cmd/.
#
# **Anchored, every one of them.** A bare `maestro-demo` matches a path
# segment at any depth, so it ignores `cmd/maestro-demo/` as well as the
# binary — which is how this line was first written, and git refused to
# add the package it had just hidden.
/maestro
/maestro-demo
/maestro-docs
/maestro-skilldoc
bin/
dist/
tmp/
*.exe

# OS noise
.DS_Store

# Working files of the impeccable skill: critique snapshots and its
# sidecar. The one input the documentation generator needs lives at
# docs/design-tokens.json instead.
.impeccable/

# Working directory of the superpowers skills: brainstorming mockups,
# design specs and implementation plans. One directory, never versioned.
.superpowers/

# Throwaway artefacts from agent sessions (screenshots, dumps, probes).
.scratch/
tmp-*.png

# Skill bundles mirrored into .claude/ for local agent sessions.
# They ship from their own upstream project; the copy here is a local
# convenience and must not be versioned.
.claude/skills/


# The documentation site, built by `make docs` from files that are
# already in the repository. Nothing commits it: GitHub Actions builds it
# on every push and publishes that.
/site/
